      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Link to Deichman music blog in Norwegian 🇳🇴 &lt;a href=&#34;https://musikk.deichman.no/2025/04/22/ferske-spor-uke-17-2025/#julian&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;relative inline-block align-text-bottom icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 448 512&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M511.1 367.1c0 44.18-42.98 80-95.1 80s-95.1-35.82-95.1-79.1c0-44.18 42.98-79.1 95.1-79.1c11.28 0 21.95 1.92 32.01 4.898V148.1L192 224l-.0023 208.1C191.1 476.2 149 512 95.1 512S0 476.2 0 432c0-44.18 42.98-79.1 95.1-79.1c11.28 0 21.95 1.92 32 4.898V126.5c0-12.97 10.06-26.63 22.41-30.52l319.1-94.49C472.1 .6615 477.3 0 480 0c17.66 0 31.97 14.34 32 31.99L511.1 367.1z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://nesrine.bandcamp.com/track/ya-lil&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nesrine – «Ya Lil»&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;1200&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;1200&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:44883/img/music/kan-ya-makan_hu_be30c02f7fedf869.jpg&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:44883/img/music/kan-ya-makan_hu_be30c02f7fedf869.jpg 800w, http://localhost:44883/img/music/kan-ya-makan.jpg 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:44883/img/music/kan-ya-makan.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA; A voice that oozes suggestion in a rhythmic Franco-Algerian backdrop of cellos. Warmth and sensibility, yet dynamic enough to weave the threads seamlessly until you&amp;rsquo;re left with a rather comfortable garment that you&amp;rsquo;ll want to wear again – and again.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
